[TITLE]
NUM-56: MODIFIED_HORTON with a maximum infiltration volume Fmax that cannot
bind. 1 in of rain in the first hour on two identical pervious subcatchments:
S1 has Fmax = 5 in, S2 has no limit (Fmax = 0). With less rain than Fmax,
both must infiltrate the same amount.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         MODIFIED_HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         KINWAVE
START_DATE           06/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    06/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             06/01/2020
END_TIME             06:00:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
DRY_STEP             01:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:00:30
IGNORE_ROUTING       YES

[EVAPORATION]
CONSTANT         0.0

[RAINGAGES]
G1   INTENSITY 1:00 1.0 TIMESERIES R1

[SUBCATCHMENTS]
;;Name Gage Outlet Area %Imperv Width %Slope CurbLen
S1   G1   O1   1.0   0   100   1.0   0
S2   G1   O1   1.0   0   100   1.0   0

[SUBAREAS]
;;Name N-Imperv N-Perv S-Imperv S-Perv PctZero RouteTo
S1   0.01   0.1   0.05   0.05   0   OUTLET
S2   0.01   0.1   0.05   0.05   0   OUTLET

[INFILTRATION]
;;Name f0 fmin decay drytime Fmax
S1   3.0   0.5   4   7   5.0
S2   3.0   0.5   4   7   0

[OUTFALLS]
O1   0   FREE

[TIMESERIES]
R1   0:00   1.0
R1   2:00   0.0

[REPORT]
SUBCATCHMENTS ALL
